{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-wigner-2-coefficient","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:wigner-2-coefficient","kind":"proposition","title":"Wigner-2 coefficient $C_{[3,2,1]} = w_{[3,2,1]} \\cdot h/2$ from self-conjugate trace pairing","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-mass-coefficient-shadow-price","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-hoefsmit-seminormal-form"],"tags":["wigner","self-conjugate","seminormal","shadow-price","isospin","cyclotomic"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.wigner2_coefficient","text":"wigner-2-coefficient.md","leanSource":"wigner-2-coefficient.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:wigner-2-coefficient\"></a><p><em>For any self-conjugate partition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda = \\lambda'</code> of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code>, the per-generator trace in the Hoefsmit seminormal representation evaluates to:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\frac{\\mathrm{tr}(\\sigma_g^{(\\lambda)})}{\\dim(\\lambda)}\n  = \\frac{h}{2}\n  = \\frac{q - q^{-1}}{2}.</code></pre>\n<p><em>Consequently, the BW shadow-price coefficient for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda</code> is:</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  C_\\lambda = w_\\lambda \\cdot \\frac{h}{2}\n  = \\frac{\\dim_q(\\lambda)^2}{[k]_q!} \\cdot \\frac{q - q^{-1}}{2}.</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/wigner-2-coefficient.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.23.9","page":"b/prop-wigner-2-coefficient","qa":{"counts":{"pass":88,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":75},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.BraidKnot.self_conjugate_trace","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/wigner-2-coefficient.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
